# Stories (/stories) runs on Supabase when these are set, and in a browser-only
# demo when they aren't. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in both values
# from your Supabase project: Project Settings > API (or Connect > App frameworks).
# The anon key is public by design; row-level security protects the data.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
